  "notes": "USAGE:\n{公募|こうぼ} emphasizes that the process is open to the general public, as opposed to internal selection or invitation-only. It is commonly used for naming contests, design competitions, job openings, and literary prizes.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {一般|いっぱん}{公募|こうぼ} (open call to the general public)\n- {公募|こうぼ}{展|てん} (open-submission exhibition)\n- {公募|こうぼ}する (to publicly solicit)\n- {公募|こうぼ}に{応|おう}じる (to respond to an open call)\n- {名前|なまえ}を{公募|こうぼ}する (to publicly solicit name suggestions)",
